.TH CR3 1 "2026-06-27" "cr3-keywords" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cr3 \- local Lightroom AI keywording and captioning pipeline for Canon CR3 photos
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cr3
.RI [ OPTIONS ] " <cr3_path> [CR3_FILE ...]"
.br
.B cr3
.BR --clear " [<cr3_path> [CR3_FILE ...]]"
.br
.B cr3
.B install
.RI " <nushell|zsh|bash>"
.br
.B cr3
.B completion
.RI " <nushell|zsh|bash>"
.br
.B cr3
.B --version
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cr3
processes .CR3 photos locally using LM Studio and writes XMP sidecar metadata.
The pipeline is: CR3 \-> JPG preview \-> TXT (keywords/caption) \-> XMP sidecar.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.BI install " TARGET"
Install shell integration for TARGET.
.TP
.BI completion " TARGET"
Print shell completion/module script to stdout for TARGET.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR -v , " --verbose"
Print detailed per-file logs.
.TP
.BR -n , " --dry-run"
Simulate actions without writing files or sending requests.
.TP
.BR -m , " --model " "MODEL"
Optional model name (default: auto-detect).
.TP
.BR -p , " --prompt " "PATH"
Prompt file path (default: ~/.cr3-keywords/prompt.md).
.TP
.BR -e , " --edit-prompt"
Open prompt file in terminal editor before running.
.TP
.BR --gps " [PATH]"
Enable GPX geotagging. Optional path (default: ~/.cr3-keywords/track.gpx).
.TP
.BR --exif
Force exiftool for CR3 preview extraction (faster, requires exiftool).
.TP
.BR --clear
Delete generated .jpg/.txt and sidecar .xmp for matching CR3 files.
.TP
.BR -h , " --help"
Show help.
.TP
.BR --version
Show version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
cr3 ~/Pictures/Canon
cr3 ~/Pictures/Canon IMG_0150.CR3 IMG_0151.CR3
cr3 --model qwen2.5-vl --prompt ~/.cr3-keywords/prompt.md --gps ~/track.gpx ~/Pictures/Canon IMG_0150.CR3
cr3 --clear
cr3 install nushell
cr3 completion zsh
.fi
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.cr3-keywords/prompt.md
Default prompt file.
.TP
.I ~/.cr3-keywords/track.gpx
Default GPX track file used when --gps is provided without a path.
.TP
.I ~/.cr3-keywords/last-run-cr3-path.txt
Last successful CR3 path used by --clear when no path is provided.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success and non-zero on error.
.SH RELATED COMMANDS
.TP
.B lms ls --json
Used for model discovery fallback when HTTP model discovery is unavailable. The CLI parses this JSON output and selects a vision-capable model key.
.TP
.B lms server start
Used to start LM Studio when the local server at http://localhost:1234 is not responding.
.TP
.B exiftool -b -PreviewImage FILE.CR3
Used to extract the embedded JPEG preview stream from CR3 files when fallback/forced exiftool extraction is active.
.TP
.B exiftool -Orientation -n -s -s -s FILE.CR3
Used to read numeric orientation for rotation correction during JPG generation.
.TP
.B exiftool -j -DateTimeOriginal -SubSecDateTimeOriginal -CreateDate FILE.CR3
Used as capture-time fallback for GPX geotagging when native metadata parsing cannot read timestamps.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR exiftool (1)
